# Copy this file to ".env" and fill it in. NEVER commit your real .env.
#
# --- Authentication (required) ---
#
# This tool signs in ONLY as a read-only app registration that you create. It never
# signs in as a person, never opens a login prompt, and never shows a device code.
# Fill in all three. The app's own token covers every plane - Graph, Azure, Dataverse,
# Power Platform. The exact least-privilege permissions are in docs/permissions.md,
# and every run starts with a setup check that tells you what is missing and how to
# fix it (run it alone with: pwsh ./scripts/check-setup.ps1).
TENANT_ID=
CLIENT_ID=
CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# --- Scope ---
#
# Dataverse environments to audit (comma-separated URLs). Leave blank to auto-discover
# them from the Power Platform sweep; the basic dataverse-sweep runs only for URLs listed here.
DATAVERSE_ENVIRONMENTS=
#
# Azure subscriptions to audit (comma-separated IDs). Leave blank to audit every
# subscription the app can read (the app needs the Reader role - see docs/permissions.md).
AZURE_SUBSCRIPTIONS=
